# From the AI Hair Color photo picker, pick the Pexels stock portrait (woman in a knitted hat, candle behind) used
# for generations: the HairColor fixtures (hc_*, Shutterstock-watermarked) are rejected by the Custom generation
# with 「Please Try Different Content」 (CONTENT_REJECTED, R1-d, credits refunded).
# Starts: the picker (after open-hair-color.steps). Ends: the colour page with that photo (Solid tab).
# Pexels search 「woman portrait」: the photo is the 2nd one in the right column. Charges nothing.
# Written 2026-11-13 on 20.19.0 (90201900), SM-S9110 (pixels).
lbl Stock
wait 4
tap 755 462
wait 2
tap 500 618
wait 1
type woman portrait
# Enter (search) is sent with adb: adb -s $CASEBOOK_SERIAL shell input keyevent 66, then: do pick-pexels-portrait-2.steps
